-150 review_evidence component:C-150 pipe:P-130 21600 N Entered: 21600 N\"':\n                - cell \"result:pressure-thrust:component-C-150 review_evidence\"\n                - cell \"component:C-150\"\n                - cell \"pipe:P-130\"\n                - cell \"21600 N\"\n                - 'cell \"Entered: 21600 N\"'\n        - region \"Mechanics gap ledger\":\n          - heading \"Mechanics Gap Ledger\" [level=3]\n          - article:\n            - strong: Endpoint-j local force/moment recovery\n            - text: implemented\n            - paragraph: End-i and end-j local force/moment preview results are emitted and paired in result detail; arbitrary station sweeps remain deferred.\n          - article:\n            - strong: Endpoint stress component recovery\n            - text: implemented\n            - paragraph: End-i and end-j open-mechanics stress component preview results are emitted and paired when stress recovery succeeds.\n          - article:\n            - strong: Intermediate station result recovery\n            - text: implemented\n            - paragraph: Fixed station-grid preview force, moment, shear force, and stress rows are emitted from interpolated endpoint resultants; arbitrary station sweeps, exact internal diagrams, and shear stress recovery remain deferred.\n          - article:\n            - strong: Pressure-to-frame load conversion\n            - text: implemented\n            - paragraph: Closed-end pressure thrust for straight preview pipes is applied to frame resultants; broader pressure behavior remains deferred.\n          - article:\n            - strong: Thermal behavior\n            - text: implemented\n            - paragraph: Uniform axial temperature-change loads for straight preview pipes are implemented with explicit material expansion input; temperature-dependent properties and thermal combinations remain deferred.\n          - article:\n            - strong: Support stiffness completeness\n            - text: deferred\n            - paragraph: Linear support restraints are preview inputs; richer stiffness and nonlinear behavior require explicit data.\n          - article:\n            - strong: Load combinations\n            - text: implemented\n            - paragraph: Explicit mechanics-basis user load combinations are emitted from matching scalar load-case result rows; code/rule combinations remain deferred/private.\n          - article:\n            - strong: Protected rule/code checks\n            - text: requires private inputs\n            - paragraph: Private criteria, allowables, SIF/flexibility tables, and code checks are not bundled publicly.\n      - region \"Comparison workspace\":\n        - text: Comparison Reference\n        - strong: load:L-100; 279 rows\n        - text: Target\n        - strong: combination:C-OPER-ALT; 261 rows\n        - text: Mapped\n        - strong: 261 comparable pairs; 23 reference-only; 0 target-only\n        - text: Tolerance\n        - strong: not_tolerance_checked; profile=TBD\n        - text: Source unit evidence\n        - strong: units=MPa,N,N*m,mm,rad; matching=equal_explicit_units; conversion=false; tolerance=not_tolerance_checked\n        - text: Boundary\n        - strong: review-only comparison\n        - paragraph: stable result IDs plus explicit source_result_refs from the preview mechanics result envelope\n        - 'button \"result:combination:combination-C-OPER-ALT:pressure-thrust:component-C-150 not tolerance checked component:C-150 expansion_joint_pressure_thrust; pipe:P-130 5400 N Reference: 21600 N Target: 27000 N\"'\n        - 'button \"result:combination:combination-C-OPER-ALT:reaction:support-S-120 not tolerance checked support:S-120 reaction_resultant; summary 191.44409499999995 N Reference: 765.77638 N Target: 957.220475 N\"'\n        - 'button \"result:combination:combination-C-OPER-ALT:moment:pipe-P-120:quarter-3:bending-z not tolerance checked pipe:P-120 bending_moment_z; quarter_3 181.39244100000008 N